From 290fea70b5123426b58a784ab836725830469ecc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jefferson Nascimento <jnsagai@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 04:54:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Rust::com: Add subscription state change APIs

Addresses #560.

Expose the proxy event subscription state to the Rust COM-API:
get_subscription_state(), set_subscription_state_change_handler() and
unset_subscription_state_change_handler(), backed by new LoLa FFI entry
points, plus the mock runtime implementation, design and user-facing
API documentation.

Adds the subscription_state_apis test application with a scripted
provider/consumer integration test.

Implemented with DeepSeek V4 Flash (Fabro); test-application ownership and
builder-type corrections by Codex.

Assisted-by: Anthropic Claude Opus 5.5 (reported in original metadata)
Assisted-by: DeepSeek V4 Flash (Fabro)
Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex (version not retained)
